00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:53.980 size:53% position:73% line:53%
maritime du Québec, à Rimouski,

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:56.850 size:53% position:73% line:53%
puis au moins cinq ans

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:57.851 size:53% position:73% line:53%
