00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:07.260 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- On dit que pour former

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:08.294 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un pilote qui pourra piloter

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:10.864 size:53% position:73% line:53%
