00:05:08.641 --> 00:05:14.314 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(musique angoissante)

00:05:12.579 --> 00:05:15.582 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est mission accomplie

00:05:13.613 --> 00:05:15.582 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour Simon et Pascal...

00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:15.582 size:53% position:73% line:53%
jusqu'au prochain navire.

